{"id":"fuerte","lemma":"fuerte","pos":"adj","rank":333,"glosses":["strong","loud","what (a/an) (intensifier, followed by a noun)"],"ipa":"/ˈfweɾte/","forms":{"femininePlural":"fuertes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-fuerte.wav","examples":[{"text":"Abra la caja fuerte.","en":"Open the safe.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501558"},{"text":"Los fuertes vientos acompañaban la lluvia.","en":"Strong winds accompanied the rain.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152103"},{"text":"Más fuerte, por favor.","en":"Louder, please.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440956"},{"text":"Los aullidos se hicieron más y más fuertes.","en":"The howls grew louder and louder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684291"},{"text":"Por favor, agárrate fuerte.","en":"Please hold on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441215"}]}